 上级知识节点\n\n- 特征值与特征向量（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n\n## 知识关系（提案，未生效）\n\n暂无关系提案。\n\n## 关联正式题\n\n暂无关联正式题。\n\n## 来源标识\n\n- 参考包运行标识：`A-math-anchor-distribution-20260909-01`\n- 包内定位：`LA07.06`（仅用于本包定位，不是本地正式 ID）\n- 来源范围：`main`；锚点类型：`knowledge`"},"source:26021688dd6a6c05199fa197":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["数项级数敛散性判别","无穷级数","正项级数敛散性判别","正项级数比较判别法","比值序列单调","相邻项比值比较"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-591/question_01.png","original_sha256":"bff104cf3394b0564ee5ccd40d1b598b52f7652c509703d90b3893ac3a03184a","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":178460,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:26021688dd6a6c05199fa197","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/3078e585035d4647dba76db16ad623504b2714bcae423c11ac191a969de101eb.json","sha256":"4144a34ce53ed092d2f2fb69b3471bff0ed4c0fd111e15486fd973ebf98150d8"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-591/question_01.png","sha256":"bff104cf3394b0564ee5ccd40d1b598b52f7652c509703d90b3893ac3a03184a"}],"text":""},"source:9d73a5313c6553ee5010e513":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["一元函数微分学应用","函数极限","复合自变量","导数定义","导数定义型极限","极限与连续","极限条件反推导数","等价无穷小","自变量增量"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-458/question_01.png","original_sha256":"057d4747c7de1e24eb656509cde9fce7907d5eafd85152423f3408b8da7ef66f","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":128143,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:9d73a5313c6553ee5010e513","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/ebb4cb9cfa72bd9a1bd15c2